\begin_inset Formula $t=3.549\,\mu\text{s}$
\end_inset
 (
\begin_inset Formula $V=55.7\,\text{kV}$
\end_inset
). The drift therefore brings the second streamer forward by about 
\begin_inset Formula $0.3\,\mu\text{s}$
\end_inset
