\begin_layout Section
Limitations
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
The impulse tail is assumed (see 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand formatted
reference "tab:tail"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"
tuple "list"

\end_inset
).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
The cloud drifts as a rigid body: velocity differences along the cloud, self-repulsion and diffusion are neglected, as in the paper.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
The second-streamer criterion (tip field back to its first-inception value) is our assumption; the paper does not state one.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
After 
\begin_inset Formula $t=3.254\,\mu\text{s}$
\end_inset
 the results ignore the second streamer that would form.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section
Reproducibility
